Archive for ORAC profiling. The tests run solvated FKPB12 with a ligand. 
FFTW3 for FFT transform must be used in all tests

This is the directory tree of the archive 
.
├── ff    ! force field tpg/prm file 
├── src   ! source code 
├── test1 ! OpenMP test (no MPI 8 OpenMP threads) 
├── test2 ! HREM test (openMP/MPI 2 threads 4 MPI procs) 
│   ├── b-RSTRT   ! contains restart files for test3 and test4 
│   ├── PAR0001   ! reference output for proc 1
│   ├── PAR0002   ! reference output for proc 2
│   ├── PAR0003   ! reference output for proc 3
│   └── PAR0004   ! reference output for proc 4
├── test3 ! alchemy test 1 (openMP/MPI 2 threads 4 MPI procs)  starts from b-RSTRT files (calls force_alchemy.f) 
│   ├── PAR0001   ! reference output for proc 1
│   ├── PAR0002	  ! reference output for proc 2
│   ├── PAR0003	  ! reference output for proc 3
│   └── PAR0004	  ! reference output for proc 4
└── test4 alchemy test 2 (openMP/MPI 2 threads 4 MPI procs)  starts from b-RSTRT files (calls force_alchemy_shifted.f )
    ├── PAR0001   ! reference output for proc 1
    ├── PAR0002	  ! reference output for proc 2
    ├── PAR0003	  ! reference output for proc 3
    └── PAR0004	  ! reference output for proc 4

Instructions on how to compile in the README file in the src directory
Instructions on how to rerun the tests in each test? directory. 
Input are designed not to overwrite the reference output
 

